# Keep the build context to what the image needs. Host node_modules hold
# platform binaries for the wrong OS, so the image always installs its own.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
.git
.github
.claude
docs
*.md
!packages/db/migrations/**
# The built KB artifact (a COPY fails without it).
!packages/kb/dist/kb.json.gz
compose.yaml
fly*.toml
